WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.060
It must be hard being a first responder would you ever consider a less stressful profession

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.500
Never

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.020
There are two types of emergency

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.260
The first kind is the one we all have every day

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.020
911 what's your emergency?

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.560
It's Choking Me, Can't Breathe.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.620
We got to help her get some air.
- Why don't I just punch it in its face?

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.120
You can't just punch snake in his
face, Buck. It's a snake!

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.220
it's not some guy at an "El Torito happy hour".

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.500
Then there's the second kind of emergency

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:42.780
The kind that comes without warning

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.880
I can help you. Please. Please.

